;  797
;  798    ! NORM_OF is norm(v [, p]): a vector's p-norm, (sum |v(k)|**p)**(1/p), 2
;  799    ! if P isn't given, its largest magnitude if P is HUGE; a matrix's norm
;  800    ! is its Frobenius norm (the 2-norm of its elements) without P, its
;  801    ! largest column sum of magnitudes with P = 1, and its largest row sum
;  802    ! with P = HUGE.
